WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.925
A function is a named set of steps. def teaches Python a new word.

2
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:10.425
Run it, and nothing is drawn. The def only says what square means.

3
00:00:13.491 --> 00:00:17.041
The steps run when you call it, by its name with brackets.

4
00:00:24.722 --> 00:00:29.747
Three calls, three squares. Change the def once, and every square changes.
